{"id":"hexe","lemma":"Hexe","pos":"noun","rank":1389,"glosses":["witch, sorceress","witch, hag (evil and/or ugly woman)"],"ipa":"/ˈhɛk.sə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/De-Hexe.ogg/De-Hexe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hexe","plural":"Hexen","masculine":"Hexer","feminine":"Hexerin"},"formAudio":{"Hexen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Hexen.wav","Hexer":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Hexer.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin keine Hexe.","en":"I'm not a witch.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann nicht hexen.","en":"I'm not a miracle worker.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Ich glaube, sie ist eine Hexe.","en":"I think she's a witch.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Die Hexe verfluchte das arme kleine Mädchen.","en":"The witch cursed the poor little girl.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to curse","l":"verfluchen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"an arm","l":"Arm"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},{"g":"girl"}]},{"text":"Hexen gibt es nicht, aber böse Menschen gibt es schon.","en":"Witches don't exist, but bad people do.","words":[null,{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"evil"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"already"}]}]}